CapabilitiesRegistry
├── whitelistCapability
│   ├── only the registry owner may replace or clear selectors
│   ├── nonempty lists require deployed capability code
│   ├── replaces the entire list, including shortening and clearing it
│   ├── an empty list revokes approval even if capability code is missing
│   └── emits the exact adapter, capability, and replacement selectors
└── capabilitySelectors and capabilitySelectorsLength
    ├── exposes selectors by index and a zero length for an unapproved pair
    ├── reverts for removed indices after shortening or clearing a list
    └── keeps approvals independent across adapters and capabilities
